## BEAM flags for a small app on a shared server (docs/PERFORMANCE.md).
## Process table: 1M slots by default (~8 MB). 64k is plenty for one app.
+P 65536
## Port/file-descriptor table: 65536 by default.
+Q 16384
## Two schedulers: each scheduler owns allocator instances (≈15 MB each on a 10-core
## host). Two are plenty for a small app; raise with ERL_AFLAGS="+S 4:4" if CPU-bound.
+S 2:2
+SDcpu 2:2
+SDio 4
## Do not spin idle schedulers (saves CPU for the other apps on the box).
+sbwt none
+sbwtdcpu none
+sbwtdio none
## Return freed carrier memory to the OS sooner.
+MBas aobf
+MHas aobf
+MMscs 0
